29
00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:13.113
(Antoni speaks foreign language)

30
00:01:13.113 --> 00:01:14.020
Take me inside

31
00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:14.853
Let's go, let's go.

32
00:01:14.853 --> 00:01:17.362
