34
00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:22.000
Yes, I want you to tell me everything.

35
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.190
First we have borscht, Polish borscht is like a

36
00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:28.480
clear consomme, and then inside you have uszka,

37
00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:30.210
