40
00:01:34.925 --> 00:01:37.920
So nice and tart. You can taste the beets.

41
00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:39.963
Ok, I'm going to try one of these.

42
00:01:39.963 --> 00:01:41.100
These are so nice. Go for it, beautiful,

43
00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.450
so as you're tasting this,

44
00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:46.550
the meat is not your packaged ground beef.

45
00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:48.100
There is something about the grinder

46
00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:49.450
that kind of turns it into almost

47
00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:52.400
like a pâté-like consistency, and it just melts.

48
00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:55.000
This is a very unique approach

49
00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.610
to the meat as you're saying.

50
00:01:56.610 --> 00:01:58.970
I also really wanna compliment you

51
00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:02.410
