52
00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:03.243
Oh

53
00:02:03.243 --> 00:02:04.740
Every ingredient resonated,

54
00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:06.940
every ingredient goes well together.

55
00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:08.050
With Let's Do Dinner,

56
00:02:08.050 --> 00:02:10.320
co-author Mindy and I really wanted to make sure,

57
00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:12.230
