69
00:02:34.310 --> 00:02:35.930
I love all things honey.

70
00:02:35.930 --> 00:02:36.763
They put it in everything.

71
00:02:36.763 --> 00:02:38.006
All right, let's go to the next place.

72
00:02:38.006 --> 00:02:39.320
