90
00:03:12.043 --> 00:03:13.299
Yeah sure.

91
00:03:13.299 --> 00:03:14.536
Oh, yeah yeah yeah.

92
00:03:14.536 --> 00:03:15.619
I just said it's nice.

93
00:03:15.619 --> 00:03:17.340
Me too, it was good, worth it.

